cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Exponential Parameter Estimation: benchmark harness and tissue dictionary for multi-exponential MR parameter estimation"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below. Code: Apache-2.0 (LICENSE); documents and data: CC BY 4.0 (LICENSE-DOCS)."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Diaz
    given-names: Eric
    email: eric.diaz@gmail.com
date-released: "2026-09-09"
version: "charter-v0.14"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >
  A Phase 0 benchmark harness (pluggable-kernel forward models, CRLB machinery, conditioning analysis, k-space-first
  simulator interface) and a provenance-flagged tissue and organ dictionary of multi-component MR properties, developed
  under a living project charter for the survey and advancement of multi-exponential parameter estimation from MR decay
  signals.
